    ]
  },
  "gaps": [
    "No data layer: copy, notes and animation offsets are inline constants in app/page.tsx.",
    "Lossless WebP hero/notes images cost ~1.9 MB each; the lossy twins already on disk are ~5-6x smaller and unused.",
    "brand-reference.png is loaded full-size (2.3 MB) and CSS-cropped to render the wordmark; the crop is not baked.",
    "Journal/news entries have no author, date, slug or standalone route, so they cannot be linked or paginated.",
    "Product has no price/SKU/inventory, so no real checkout can be built on the current model.",
    "Search vocabulary is a hand-written keyword string, not derived from the data.",
    "No LICENSE file upstream, so reuse/redistribution rights are unclear.",
    "Every animation is keyed to global CSS class names; renaming a class silently kills the animation."
  ]
}
